19-/**
20- * Every op that claims an `old` block must quote it verbatim. A claim that does not
21- * match the real body is never trusted into an "elaborated" or "removed" tag — it is
22- * demoted to a plain `new` (if it carried one) plus the real old block left as
23- * `removed`. This is the whole point: a wrong claim can never silently mis-render.
24- */
